<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-13T09:47:58.204Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:47:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has carried out airstrikes on Gaza’s Nasser Hospital, killing at least six people including a doctor, a child and a senior Hamas commander inside the facility. Heavy storms have flooded tens of thousands of tents in Gaza, leaving many displaced in lethal conditions as aid distribution stalls. UNRWA funding cuts have deepened hardship for Palestinian refugees in Lebanon, while restrictions on aid have left Gaza families struggling to keep warm, with a baby reported to have died from cold. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/israeli-strike-on-gaza-hospital-kills-six-including-surgeon-medics-say&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/11/13/unrwa-funding-cuts-deepen-hardship-for-palestinian-refugees-in-lebanon?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/12/lewis-hamilton-gaza-visit-rafah-israel&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxOaFo1ZDdUVlo4bHVVckx2ZkpOazJxa2Z6ZjhDNmhfamN4Q3g0LWdsaGNudjllVHBKYzlJRWgzSzJZbi01RlZJZXFTdk4wY3BFUDFIekFoMWh3M1J3amNfaFUtXzE4Z21OMDVYcV9YMVBoXzdHVzN4LXJIbG9DRFdCUzU1S3gwcGVTOWFRcFVBNXp3Y0ZVb01wbjd0WW1FekgwUEZDNnBnVllLcGJmYTJOcW83aWtmYnZYT3EteEduZWJmMnowOEJjN1dIX0dtZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/13/gaza-surgeon-films-aftermath-of-israeli-strike?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPUjZqYm85b08tN2lDMnM4aXJURWdKXzB6M3pwYmxBVEVfZFNEbEM2eFVZSy01aEpYSkdGbVNPdGFqekJrUkVZYWJDTWlWbldBaXZyT2UwSzEwQUF